* ''Rhamnus oleoides'' subsp. ''bourgaeana'' {{mida|1=(Gand.) Rivas Mart. & J.M.Pizarro}}
* ''Rhamnus oleoides'' subsp. ''oleoides''
* ''Rhamnus oleoides'' subsp. ''rivasgodayana'' {{mida|1=Rivas Mart. & J.M.Pizarro}}
{{refend}}

